[[SECTION]]
UID: SEC-IA
TITLE: Identity & Access

[TEXT]
UID: SEC-IA-INTRO
STATEMENT: >>>
Identity and access actions for ReqAML — SSO sign-in/out, client scoped view, profile, project grant administration, and catalog-steward grants.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A01
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Sign in via SSO
STATEMENT: >>>
A user signs in via enterprise SSO (OIDC or SAML). ReqAML validates the IdP token,
establishes a least-privilege session, loads project grants, and emits an auditable sign-in event.
No local password store exists; MFA is enforced at the IdP. Downstream APIs reject callers without a valid session.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A01
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: auth:signin
priority: 10
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: IA-2
security.verification_note: IA-2 / AC-3 / AU-2/3/12. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222536 (password length IdP-delegated); no local passwords; MFA at IdP.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-SSO
edge: ← refines from ARCH-OTEL
edge: ← refines from MC01.1
edge: ← refines from ARCH-DEVENV-IDENTITY
edge: ← uses from FIX-DENY-DEVENV-PROD-LOGIN
edge: ← refines from ARCH-DEVENV-IDENTITY.1
edge: ← uses from FIX-DENY-DEVENV-PROD-LOGIN.1
edge: ← refines from ARCH-AUTH-AS
edge: ← refines from ARCH-AUTH-FEDERATION
edge: ← uses from FIX-ALLOW-FEDERATED-SSO-VIA-AS
edge: ← refines from ARCH-AUTH-LOCAL.1
edge: ← refines from ARCH-AUTH-PROFILE
edge: ← uses from FIX-DENY-LOCAL-LOGIN-PROFILE-OFF
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-SSO.1
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
in_scope_of_contract: Platform baseline
in_scope_of_contract: Legacy intake (closed)
in_scope_of_contract: Fixture doc-walk
delivered_by_release: R0-sequences
edge: → conforms_to to AC-3 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to IA-2 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to SC-8 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to V-222536 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
edge: → conforms_to to AU-12 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to AU-2 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to AU-3 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
<<<
