[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A03
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Select Client Scoped View
STATEMENT: >>>
An authenticated user selects a Client Scoped View. The active clientId is persisted server-side so
subsequent queries and mutations are bound to that client for least privilege.
The UI App shell reads the bound clientId from the session; client-side-only scope is not authoritative.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A03
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: client:scope:select
priority: 10
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: AC-3
security.verification_note: AC-3/AC-6 least privilege via server-bound scope. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222429 / V-222550.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-SCOPED-VIEW
edge: ← uses from B08
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-SCOPED-VIEW.1
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
in_scope_of_contract: Platform baseline
delivered_by_release: R0-sequences
edge: → conforms_to to AC-3 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to AC-6 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to V-222429 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
edge: → conforms_to to V-222550 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
<<<
