[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A05
STATUS: Active
TITLE: View own profile / grants
STATEMENT: >>>
A user views their own profile and project grants. ReqAML returns only the caller's identity record and
grants (no cross-subject disclosure). Grant role names and project ids are included so the UI can render
authorized navigation without a separate admin call.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A05
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: identity:read_self
priority: 40
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: AC-3
security.verification_note: AC-3 self-read boundary; AU access logging where required. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222430.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RBAC
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RBAC.1
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
delivered_by_release: R0-sequences
edge: → conforms_to to V-222430 (pin imprint=asd-stig@v6r4)
edge: → conforms_to to AC-3 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
<<<
