edge: ← refines from ARCH-CRED-REAUTH
edge: ← uses from FIX-DENY-PRIV-NO-MFA
edge: ← uses from ARCH-AUTH-CLAIM-MAP
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RBAC.1
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
delivered_by_release: R0-sequences
edge: → conforms_to to AC-3 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
edge: → conforms_to to AC-6 (pin imprint=nist-800-53@rev5-dogfood-20261006)
