[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A08
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Revoke project role
STATEMENT: >>>
A project admin revokes a project role from an identity. ReqAML removes or tombstones the grant and audits
the revocation. Active sessions for the subject lose the role on the next authorization check;
desk attachments that required the role are detached.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A08
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: project:grant:revoke
priority: 50
iteration: iter-r0
security.catalog_ref: AC-2
security.verification_note: AC-2/AC-3 revoke path; AU-2/3/12. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222467 / V-222407.
