[REQUIREMENT]
UID: A09
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Grant catalog-steward role
STATEMENT: >>>
A client or project admin grants catalog-steward at global, client, or project scope to an identity.
ReqAML records the steward grant at the requested catalog scope and audits actor, subject, and scope.
Only stewards may mutate non-standard catalog entries at their scope; standard catalogs remain read-only.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: requirement
BASE_UID: A09
VERSION_N: 0
rbac_op: catalog:steward:grant
priority: 55
iteration: iter-r1
security.catalog_ref: AC-2
security.verification_note: AC-2 account management for steward roles; AU-2/3/12. ASD STIG V6R4 V-222407 / V-222467.
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RBAC
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RBAC.1
in_scope_of_contract: Design-2026-10
in_scope_of_contract: Security package
