[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-AUTH-PKCE
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Authorization code + PKCE S256 only
STATEMENT: >>>
The authorization endpoint requires PKCE with code_challenge_method=S256. Requests that use plain or omit the challenge are rejected (invalid_request) and no code is issued. AS metadata advertises code_challenge_methods_supported=["S256"]. Authorization codes are single-use and short-lived, bound to client_id, redirect_uri (exact match), and code_challenge. State is required, and the authorization response carries iss (RFC 9207).
<<<
