[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-AUTH-METADATA
STATUS: Active
TITLE: AS metadata (RFC 8414) + protected resource metadata (RFC 9728)
STATEMENT: >>>
The AS publishes Authorization Server Metadata (RFC 8414) at /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server, plus OpenID Connect discovery for interop. The metadata issuer is identical to the issuer URL. The MCP server and the API each publish OAuth Protected Resource Metadata (RFC 9728) at /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource, listing the internal AS in authorization_servers and stating their canonical resource URI. A request without a valid token gets 401 with WWW-Authenticate: Bearer resource_metadata="…" so MCP clients can discover the AS.
<<<
