[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-AUTH-REVOKE
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Token revocation and session-linked teardown
STATEMENT: >>>
The AS exposes token revocation (RFC 7009) for refresh and access tokens. Sign-out (A02) revokes the session's refresh tokens and desk attachments. Disabling or deleting an account, or revoking a grant that removes all access, terminates that subject's sessions and token families. Resource servers reject revoked tokens through introspection or short access-token lifetimes plus revocation checks.
<<<
