[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-AUTH-CLIENTREG
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Client registration: pre-registered baseline; CIMD/DCR policy-gated
STATEMENT: >>>
First-party clients (Web UI, admin-configured ReqAML MCP clients) are pre-registered with exact redirect URIs. Client ID Metadata Documents and Dynamic Client Registration (RFC 7591; deprecated in the MCP 2026-07-28 revision) ship disabled by default. An admin can enable either one per deployment or per client policy, and every registration is audited. When DCR is disabled, registration_endpoint is omitted from AS metadata and registration requests are refused. Confidential-client secrets are stored hashed (ARCH-CRED-TOKENS).
