[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-AUTH-LOCAL
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Local accounts: optional per auth profile (off by default in production)
STATEMENT: >>>
The internal identity store supports local accounts that bind to the same identity rows and grants as federated identities. Local accounts are required for development (seeded dev accounts, ARCH-DEVENV-IDENTITY.1) and available to deployments whose policy enables them; production enablement and eligible users are an open question. Every local credential is subject to ARCH-CRED-*. Account create/modify/disable/remove is automated and audited, and unnecessary or built-in accounts are disabled.
