[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-VER
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Line versions; ≤1 active; prior→superseded in-place on activate
STATEMENT: >>>
Each requirement line has versions with UIDs base_uid or base_uid.N (static append). Children stay on the parent line (parent = base_uid); there is no cascade fork. INVARIANT: ≤1 active version per line. When a new tip is activated (D04), the prior active version is set to superseded IN PLACE in the same transaction (not a new version). Terminal obsolete/withdraw without replacement may be in-place status or a status-only .N (mint_kind=status) — see D05 / ARCH-MINT-KIND / FIX-ALLOW-STATUS-SUPERSEDE.
