[[SECTION]]
UID: SEC-CAT
TITLE: Catalogs

[TEXT]
UID: SEC-CAT-INTRO
STATEMENT: >>>
Catalogs provide standard and project templates. Standard catalogs (NIST/STIG) are versioned as imprints; project REQAML-SEC-* entries are steward-mutable until imprint publish. Stewardship, browse, reference, copy, imprint publish, import-diff, drift review, migrate-to-imprint (preview + apply), and pin semantics live here.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: H01
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Create catalog
STATEMENT: >>>
A catalog steward creates a catalog at global, client, or project scope. ReqAML inserts catalog
metadata with is_standard flag; standard catalogs are immutable after publish policy.
<<<
