UID: ARCH-CAT-VISIBILITY
STATUS: Active
TITLE: User-selected visible catalogs
STATEMENT: >>>
The user shall choose which catalogs are visible in browse and trace views per user per project; the selection shall persist in server-side session or profile state keyed by (identity_id, project_id). The default when unset shall be all catalogs that have at least one conforms_to or catalog link in the project. Hidden catalogs shall not appear in control rollups or two-column catalog views until selected.
