[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CAP-HEALTH-LIVENESS
STATUS: Active
TITLE: /health liveness probe with version
STATEMENT: >>>
GET /health is liveness only: it returns 200 with status ok, the app version and mode whenever the process can serve HTTP, and never touches Postgres, OpenBao or client data. Acceptance: /health stays 200 while dependencies are down (OpenBao sealed, Postgres stopped) so orchestrators do not restart a healthy process for a dependency outage.
<<<
