[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CAP-READY-PROBES
STATUS: Active
TITLE: /ready live peripheral and per-role checks (cached, time-boxed)
STATEMENT: >>>
GET /ready live-probes Postgres (SELECT 1), pending migrations, OpenBao (initialized, unsealed, Transit encrypt/decrypt round-trip on reqaml-kek) and each enabled role, caching results for REQAML_READY_CACHE_MS (2 s) and bounding each probe by REQAML_READY_PROBE_TIMEOUT_MS (3 s). It returns 503 with the failing check named and recovers without a restart. Acceptance: sealing OpenBao gives 503 with openbao failing; stopping Postgres gives 503 with database failing; both return to 200 after recovery; the app container is not restarted.
<<<
