[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CAP-UI-FRAME
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: UI frame: app shell, layout, guarded routes
STATEMENT: >>>
The Web UI frame served by the web role: top navigation, client-scoped sidebar chrome, and route guards that send unauthenticated users to the internal-AS sign-in flow and keep `/app/*` behind a valid API-audience session via HttpOnly SameSite=Lax cookies (BFF) with CSRF on sign-out; API clients use bearer tokens. Sign-out revokes refresh tokens via RFC 7009. Acceptance: unauthenticated `/app` redirects to login; authenticated shell renders `/api/v1/me` grants.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: capability
BASE_UID: CAP-UI-FRAME
VERSION_N: 0
priority: 10
