STATEMENT: >>>
The product shall provide a two-column traceability view with catalog controls on the left and capabilities on the right, joined by conforms_to edges. Selecting a row on either column shall highlight the active joined path on both columns. Direct ConformsTo pins shall render as solid links; inherited or aggregated links shall render dashed. A control shall be treated as heavy when it has more than 25 direct capability links in the current project view; heavy controls shall collapse into bundles by default with an expand affordance.
