UID: ARCH-TRACE-LAYOUT-WORKER
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Off-main-thread trace layout engine
STATEMENT: >>>
Layout, link aggregation, and rollup math for trace views shall run behind one small TypeScript interface executed off the main thread (Web Worker). The default implementation shall be plain TypeScript. WebAssembly shall be adopted only when plain TypeScript layout exceeds 50 ms at P95 on a reference project size (full dogfood trace graph).
