Security-relevant actions emit structured audit events exported via OTEL (OTLP) for centralized
review, aligned to NIST AU-2/3/6/9/12. Session teardown destroys session identifiers (V-222578).
Auditors read via M01/M02; actors cannot alter prior audit rows (AU-9).
