edge: ← satisfies from CAP-READ-RELEASES
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-READ-HIERARCHY
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-RELATIONS-API
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-CATALOGS-API
delivered_by_release: R1 — defineOperationRoute (single business-route pipeline)
