[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-CRED
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Credential store controls
STATEMENT: >>>
Credential store controls cover every credential ReqAML holds or verifies: local passwords, MFA authenticators, OAuth refresh tokens, authorization codes, client secrets, and session identifiers. Credentials are never stored or logged in plaintext. Each one is either one-way hashed (verify-only) or wrapped by the key store (must be usable), per ARCH-KEY.
<<<
