[[SECTION]]
UID: ARCH-CRED-CHILDREN
TITLE: Children of ARCH-CRED

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-CRED-HASH
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Passwords stored only as salted approved one-way hashes (configurable params)
STATEMENT: >>>
Local passwords are stored only as salted, approved one-way hashes with a per-credential random salt. Algorithm and cost parameters are configuration, not a hard-coded library: Argon2id where FIPS mode is not required, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256/512 (FIPS-approved) where FIPS-validated crypto is required (ARCH-KEY-FIPS). Each stored hash records its algorithm and parameters, and an outdated hash is re-hashed on the next successful login. Passwords travel only over TLS and are never displayed or logged.
<<<
