UID: ARCH-CRED-POLICY
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Password / authenticator policy presets
STATEMENT: >>>
Password and authenticator policy (minimum length, composition or blocklist, change distance, minimum and maximum lifetime, reuse history, temporary password with forced change) is a configurable preset per deployment. The DoD-facing preset meets ASD STIG V6R4 values. Default and seeded credentials must be changed before first use, and production must not contain any.
