[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-CRED-LOCKOUT
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Throttling and lockout after failed attempts
STATEMENT: >>>
The AS throttles authentication per account and per source, and locks a local account after N consecutive failed attempts within a window (configurable; DoD preset 3 in 15 minutes). While locked, even a correct password is refused with the same generic error, and failures never reveal whether an account exists. Unlock happens only through an approved admin process (auth:account:unlock) or the configured timer. Every failure, lockout, and unlock is audited.
<<<
