[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-CRED-REAUTH
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Re-authentication (step-up) for sensitive actions
STATEMENT: >>>
Sensitive actions require recent authentication (step-up): line or tree approve (D12/D13), capability approve, ConformsTo pin apply/deny, gate sign-off, release ship, grant and role administration, client registration, and key operations. If auth_time is older than the configured max_age, or MFA is missing for a privileged slot, the action returns a step-up challenge and nothing is written.
