priority: 5
iteration: iter-r1
security.catalog_ref: SC-12
security.verification_note: SC-12 / SC-12(2) / SC-12(3); AU-2.
edge: ← uses from FIX-ALLOW-KEK-REWRAP-ONLINE
edge: ← satisfies from CAP-KEY-ENVELOPE
edge: ← refines from ARCH-KEY-RUNTIME-CACHE
delivered_by_release: R1 — foundation shell + internal auth
