[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-KEY-CUSTODIAN
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Key custodian role (separation of duties)
STATEMENT: >>>
Key operations (KEK/DEK rotate, revoke, destroy, provider reconfigure, recovery) need the deployment-scoped Key custodian role. No existing role fits: project and client roles are tenant-scoped, and the permission tree has no ops or deployment role ('No separate Deployer in v1'). For separation of duties, the Key custodian is distinct from Client admin and Project admin, and holding both on one deployment is refused unless a documented exception is approved. The role grants no access to requirement content. Scheduled automatic rotation runs as an audited system principal.
<<<
