UID: ARCH-KEY-FAILCLOSED
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Fail closed when the KEK / KeyProvider is unavailable
STATEMENT: >>>
In production, ReqAML fails closed when the KEK or KeyProvider is unreachable or sealed. The app does not start or reports not ready (ARCH-DEVENV-HEALTH / M04), and it refuses operations that need key material. It never falls back to plaintext, cached plaintext KEKs on disk, or a dev provider. Unavailability is audited and alerted.
