[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-REQ-VS-CAP
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Client sys-req vs CapabilityLine first-class; canonical need→solution path
STATEMENT: >>>
Client system requirements (RequirementLine: kind requirement|section|control) and contractor capabilities (CapabilityLine: kind=capability) share line/version storage but are distinct SubjectKinds with often different RoleBindings and gates. Canonical early path: draft client req → optional activate → line approve → create CapabilityLine with Satisfies → cap approve as solution → profile-gated planning (priority/grooming/…) → later ship with profile Gates. Satisfies is the primary coverage edge (not implements in v1 encode).
<<<
