STATEMENT: >>>
Suspect review queue actions: carry-forward (retarget edge/junction to new tip), keep-pinned (acknowledge stale pin, clear suspect flag without retarget), drop (remove edge/junction). Every reaction is audited. Role defaults: Satisfies/refines/uses → Author; ConformsTo → Security; contract/release membership → Author + Release manager. Mirrors ARCH-CAT-REACT pattern for internal traces.
