UID: ARCH-DEVENV-SEED
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Migrations and dogfood seed on first start (idempotent)
STATEMENT: >>>
On first start (or via one documented command), database migrations and the dogfood seed load run so a fresh instance can act as fixture data and a test oracle. Re-running migrations and seed load is idempotent: repeat application does not duplicate rows or fail on already-applied schema. Seed load must not be required as a production deployment step.
