[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CAP-DEVENV-LF-ENDINGS
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Git LF line endings for Compose entrypoints
STATEMENT: >>>
Repository line endings are enforced for the Compose dev stack: a root .gitattributes keeps shell entrypoints and Docker/Compose context files as LF in Git so Linux containers never see a bash\r shebang when Windows Git checks out with core.autocrlf=true. Documented recovery re-normalizes an existing Windows working tree after pulling the fix.
<<<
