[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CAP-DEVENV-OPENBAO-BOOTSTRAP
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dev OpenBao Transit KEK bootstrap and round-trip
STATEMENT: >>>
On first start the peripherals container initializes OpenBao (1 key share, dev-only), stores the unseal key and root token in the reqaml-secrets volume, enables Transit with a reqaml_dev=true mount description, and creates the non-exportable aes256-gcm96 KEK reqaml-kek; later starts unseal from the stored key. The app proves the KEK works with a Transit encrypt/decrypt round-trip in /ready. Acceptance: fresh volumes initialize in seconds; /ready reports openbao ok only after a successful round-trip; restarts keep the KEK.
<<<
