BASE_UID: CAP-DEVENV-SEED-RESET
VERSION_N: 0
priority: 10
iteration: iter-r1
security.catalog_ref: CM-2
security.verification_note: Planned until seed-reset PR merges and is verified locally.
delivered_by_release: R1 — dev dogfood seed reset (pnpm devenv:seed:reset)
<<<
